          "items": [
            "After Dune Delight by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br><br>Just a block from the Donut Hole, in the community of Inlet Beach, After Dune Delight is just steps away from 30Avenue. With trendy offices, great dining, and upscale shopping, it's a great spot for a stylish coastal experience. And really good food!<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Inlet Beach, next to 30Avenue’s dining hub!<br>👣 .6 miles to Wall Street Beach Access<br>👙 Steps to heated community pool!<br>🛏️ 3 bedrooms, 2.5 baths<br>🪞 Gorgeous interiors<br>🚲 4 bikes<br>🍤 Charcoal grill<br>🦞 Near Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach<br>🛍️ Cute shops and boutiques<br><br>In the beautiful 3-bedroom two-story home, the first floor is a colorful, open living-dining area and kitchen. The second-floor features three bedrooms, including a primary bedroom, king, with a private bath and its own balcony/deck. A guest room, king, shares hall bath with the third bedroom, featuring a bunk bed with full-size mattresses.<br><br>With access to a sparkling heated community pool, easy beach access, outdoor dining tables, a grill, a small office, and four bicycles waiting for you, all you need to do is pack your bags—and maybe learn how to ride a bike again!<br><br>The Inlet Beach Underpass is designed for pedestrian and cyclist safety at the intersection of Highway 98 and 30A and it provides a safe crossing beneath busy traffic, connecting beach access, shops and restaurants. It includes art murals by local artists.<br><br>Welcome! Our dedicated team at Oversee 30A, a local company, is committed to ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. We strive for perfection and are just a stone's throw away should you require any assistance. Reach out to us anytime, seven days a week, with the added peace of a 24/7 emergency line.<br><br>Overview:<br>- 3 bedrooms, 2.5 baths<br>- 1,856 square feet<br>- .6 miles to the beach (Wall Street Access)<br>- Wi-Fi<br>- Cable via YouTube TV/ 3 smart TVs<br>- Steps to seasonally heated community pool<br>- Gas grill<br>- 4 bikes included<br><br>Overnight:<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Pull-out couch in living room with queen size mattress, TV<br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- King in 2nd floor primary, private bath, TV<br>- King in 2nd floor guest room, shared bath, TV<br>- Two fulls (bunk bed) in 2nd floor guest room, shared bath<br><br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
